# Asleep on an unmade bed (issue 053): the full 80x96 bed-unmade (5x6) with the same sleeper as player-sleep-bed (head on the west pillow, covers pulled up over connected shoulders and a body-shaped bulge down to the feet), pasted over the rumpled bed. Replaces the bed sprite while sleeping when bedMade is 0.
size: 80x96
